b-448d-b8e0-ef6dd3cfbe2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a2c84a12077849aaaebdf5378783453f 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I wanted to request you to draw my original character Ren. Pose and composition completely up to you!\n\nRen is a gamer who spends most of her time playing \"League of Legends\". She's usually angry tired or annoyed. \nShe has pink eyes and short teal hair that's pulled back into a top knot. Usually she wears a black hoodie, detailed with a set of eyes on the front, and black street-wear styled pants with light blue hanging straps.\nHer left arm has been almost completely taken over by a blood parasite so she almost always has it gloved.\nShe is also a hemomancer and can make daggers from her own blood if that brings up any fun ideas.\n\nReferences: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lzW9KJEIu2sFNYZ8uVM01BTE_nbM5VXG?usp=sharing\n\nThis work could be used for non-profit AMV  videos and graphic design banners made for fun on youtube/twitter.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@gmbp1228/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1697131, "client_id": 153686, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8a0d381/uploads/origins/a01124b9-fe73-416d-a239-e61d8f8114f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f6290387ff58d42d209fd5fa74f9fed", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d8a0d381/uploads/origins/a01124b9-fe73-416d-a239-e61d8f8114f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f6290387ff58d42d209fd5fa74f9fed, https://si.imgix.net/d8a0d381/uploads/origins/a01124b9-fe73-416d-a239-e61d8f8114f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6aa2efcaf8c095c175e26848c190d852 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d8a0d381/uploads/origins/a01124b9-fe73-416d-a239-e61d8f8114